// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// 10. FORMATTING NOTES
// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Total Sales              → Format: Currency, $#,##0.00
// Total Profit             → Format: Currency, $#,##0.00
// Total Item Revenue       → Format: Currency, $#,##0.00
// Average Order Value      → Format: Currency, $#,##0.00
// Avg Profit per Order     → Format: Currency, $#,##0.00
// Distinct Orders          → Format: Whole Number, #,##0
// Late Delivery Rate %     → Format: Percentage, 0.00%
// Profit Margin %          → Format: Percentage, 0.00%
// Sales MoM Growth %       → Format: Percentage, 0.00%
// Avg Actual Shipping Days → Format: Decimal, 0.0
// Avg Scheduled Ship Days  → Format: Decimal, 0.0
// Avg Shipping Delay Days  → Format: Decimal, 0.0
